PTX cta-init+tma
"Pipeline set-up in a one-CTA cluster: one thread initializes the mbarrier, fence.mbarrier_init.release.cluster, bar.sync; another thread then arrives with expect_tx and issues a TMA copy that completes on the barrier (CUTLASS sm90_pipeline.hpp:305-323). The waiter must see the copied data. Expected: forbidden."
{
g=5;
d=0 @cta 0;
f=mbarrier() @cta 0;
P1:r1=0;
P1:r2=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0            | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                                                  ;
 mbarrier.init.shared::cta f, 1      | bar.sync 0                                                                ;
 fence.mbarrier_init.release.cluster | mbarrier.arrive.expect_tx.release.cta f, 1                                ;
 bar.sync 0                          | cp.async.bulk.shared::cluster.global.mbarrier::complete_tx::bytes d, g, f ;
                                     | mbarrier.try_wait.parity.acquire.cta r1, f, 0                             ;
                                     | ld.weak.shared::cta r2, d                                                 ;
exists
(P1:r1 == 1 /\ P1:r2 != 5)
